SUMMARY: Softie\, Tim Felton comedy
DESCRIPTION:Sometimes a dad is also a daddy. And sometimes that daddy is 
 also a Softie. Chicago based comedian\, Tim Felton (Picture the lovechild
  of Mr. Rogers\, Pee-wee Herman\, and Buster Bluth)\, coming hot off his 
 debut at Chicago's renowned Steppenwolf Theater invites you along in his 
 journey to figure out how to connect with people as he gets older....and 
 softer. Part flirting with your barista\, part confiding in your bestie\,
  Softie explores the challenges in making and maintaining relationships i
 n an increasingly individualized existence.\n\nTickets available on our w
 ebsite!
